(4605904, 665138, 25355, '<td valign="top">Not having spent very much time in the US (and mostly away from the big cities), it seems to me that whenever I see a picture of a "homeless veteran", they always have a long greyish beard. I suppose it''s some kind of uniform for them....<br/>  And I wonder, at what stage do they change from "homeless novice" to "homeless veteran"?</td>', 'Not having spent very much time in the US (and mostly away from the big cities), it seems to me that whenever I see a picture of a "homeless veteran", they always have a long greyish beard. I suppose it''s some kind of uniform for them....  And I wonder, at what stage do they change from "homeless novice" to "homeless veteran"?', '2008-04-02 08:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
